  "question": "Where are a hospital positioned within 190 kilometers in the direction of north from Bill Harris Arena, Birmingham, AL?",
  "sql": "\nWITH origin AS  (SELECT ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-86.874042 33.494874)',4326)::geography AS geometry)\nSELECT * FROM pois, origin\nWHERE ST_DWithin(pois.geometry, ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-86.874042 33.494874)',4326)::geography, 190000)\nAND amenity = 'hospital'\nAND ((degrees(ST_Azimuth(origin.geometry, pois.geometry)) BETWEEN 0.0 AND 22.5) OR (degrees(ST_Azimuth(origin.geometry, pois.geometry)) BETWEEN 337.5 AND 360));\n",
